357:+    # 一条 FAILED 都没有，集合比对会判成「少红」还是「相等」全看运气 —— 两种都
362:+        if (ln.startswith("FAILED ") or ln.startswith("ERROR ")) and "::" in ln
369:+    return r.returncode, failed, (tail[-1] if tail else "<no summary>")
